{"pin":"AB00585","subcodes":[{"code":"AB00585","anchor":"","first_line":"O distinguished one! The written missive was perused and its purpose became evident. In truth, in this day thou art rendering service [3.5s]... ...In truth thou art now rendering a great service to the basic foundations of the Cause of God... As to the question of the twelfth Imam, there existeth in the ?adíths an apparent contradiction.","first_line_orig":"ای صدرالصدور رق منشور قرائت گشت مقصد معلوم گردید فی الحقیقه الیوم آنحضرت خدمت  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"510","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"AVK2.222.13x","source":"AVK2","locator":"222.13x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/AK2/ak2-223.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MAS2.050-052x","source":"MAS2","locator":"050-052x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MAS2/mas2-51.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK6#601x","source":"MMK6","locator":"601x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/1699.pdf#page=439"},{"kind":"publication","code":"TSS.147","source":"TSS","locator":"147","url":"https://adibmasumian.files.wordpress.com/2021/02/tss.pdf#page=150"},{"kind":"translation","code":"ADMS#019x","source":"ADMS","locator":"019x","url":"https://adibmasumian.com/translations/protect-bearer-snow-white-scroll/"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BLO_PT#001x","source":"BLO_PT","locator":"001x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/abdulbaha_masumian_twelfth_imam"},{"kind":"translation","code":"COC#0388x","source":"COC","locator":"0388x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/compilation_importance_deepening#388"},{"kind":"translation","code":"KFPT#03.6","source":"KFPT","locator":"03.6","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160308184005/http://fananapazir.co.nr/sixtranslations.html"}]},{"code":"AB00585DIS","anchor":"dis","translations":[{"language":"bn","lang_name":"Bengali"}]}]}
